Cell["\<\
On curved substrates the sign of the curvature shows: positive at the centre \
of a sphere mesh, negative on a hyperbolic tiling. The dimension read on the \
hyperbolic tiling is not 2: its balls grow exponentially, and only four radii \
fit before the rim.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"194776e5-5aea-4479-bfc2-82ba3aa6a3e8"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

